{"summary":"Cozy miniature adventure about changing the world, using the power of stickers!","description":"A Tiny Sticker Tale is a cozy miniature adventure about changing the world, using the power of stickers!\n\n*It is an emotional and short experience whose main story can be enjoyed in approximately 2 hours.\n\nIn A Tiny Sticker Tale, take anything from the world around you, turn it into a sticker, and use your creativity to stick it back in different places, solving puzzles, and helping your new friends!\n\nIn this wholesome bite-sized adventure, step into the tiny boots of Flynn, the donkey, and journey across Figori Island, discovering the vibrant quests that will require the power of a very special magical sticker book.\n\nGame Features\n\n+ Unique gameplay, use your creativity to solve puzzles by taking and placing stickers in different places\n+ Change your surroundings by placing stickers\n+ Customize and decorate your Island however you want!\n+ Gorgeous, inviting art style, Figori Island is the perfect place to rest up after a long day of adventuring\n+ Discover a detailed and fascinating Island full of mystery and adventure\n+ Collect all stickers from the Island\n\n*A Tiny Sticker Tale is designed to be a short adventure filled with many details, great additional content to the main story, and a lot of replayability!\n\nOgre Pixel - 2024","esrbNotes":null,"pegiNotes":null,"iapPrices":null,"video":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/pjviYc4LQm0?vq=large&rel=0&autohide=1&showinfo=0","header":"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/95hcgcYSUauL2ANiL4IzFNCgM64U5NZ5KtegD8zw1zm383GbqQxap4hIJy6fM9o6htO-SpdFmA0i486_gIe73A","screenshots":["https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/B2J4tAGr62bQAFBZ-Le0P0oteRJ3_VNTC952_Ym-MNJ_EoaW42O4g6TQXc8YqatVnqlwrwhRlxfZ-B0EwI6x0Vs","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/sYg5WJBG2YXczqcx8YrSl2qIuy778SzvWaF3eoq032nNJxiw4zEtAcSosWxqLzgjEIob-puIlfiTDC_f3ZrW9Q","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/RbpW0DImwSER2Nmn47nqlz1MDSAB4i13EfacKf